As someone who doesn’t drink beer, finding a spot that serves great cider means I am definitely going back. Unsung Brewing at Anaheim Make is exactly that place. 

The best part is knowing this will be the new go-to spot for me and my friends. I am already picturing us heading over here after watching a movie like Supergirl, grabbing a cider or a beer, and just chatting about the film. The whole space has a relaxed, comic book inspired atmosphere that feels completely natural if you are into that culture.

Have you found a local spot like this with ciders and a great vibe?

